<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise, Suez silent on linkup report.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise, Suez silent on linkup report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lyonnaise des Eaux and Compagnie de Suez would not comment on a report in the daily Le Figaro the two companies were once again considering a linkup.</p>
<p>Suez and Lyonnaise spokeswomen said the groups' policy was not to comment on &quot;rumours&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;Considered several times and regularly postponed, the last time in 1995, this operation is once again under review,&quot; Le Figaro said, citing sources close to the affair.</p>
<p>Suez was up 4.79 percent at 243 francs and Lyonnaise gained 3.74 percent at 555 francs at 0935 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
